<title>CHINA: McDonald's to open 11 more restaurants in Shanghai.</title>
<headline>McDonald's to open 11 more restaurants in Shanghai.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald's Corp plans to open 11 more restaurants in Shanghai this year, bringing the number of its outlets in China's largest city to 28, the China Daily Business Weekly said on Sunday.</p>
<p>McDonald's now has 128 restaurants in China in 17 Chinese cities including 30 in Beijing, it said.</p>
